    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοικεί-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>binding together, bringing into combination</i>, in
			Astrol. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a figure in
			Rhetoric, <i>whereby heterogeneous things were combined</i> or
				<i>attributed to one person.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1425b38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Rutil.
				2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				9.3.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>allegorical identification</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
